NAME
    gcloud gemini gibq-observability-settings - manage Gibq Observability
        Setting resources

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud gemini gibq-observability-settings GROUP | COMMAND
        [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    Manage Gibq Observability Setting resources.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

GROUPS
    GROUP is one of the following:

     setting-bindings
        Manage Setting Binding resources.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     create
        Create gibqObservabilitySettings.

     delete
        Delete gibqObservabilitySettings.

     describe
        Describe gibqObservabilitySettings.

     list
        List gibqObservabilitySettings.

     update
        Update gibqObservabilitySettings.
